WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
yobidashitaru sonata e to

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
Thou, who hast here summoned the likes of me,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
michibikareshi mi wo

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
Bestow thou me guidance from thine own body.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
sashidasu wa senketsu no

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
Hark as this fresh blood from my fingertips flows,

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
yubisaki no akashi

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
As proof of our contract: Our destiny --

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
hikari no kami mo azamuku chikai

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
A vow to betray even the gods of Light.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
ochiru kogareru inochi wo toshite seiyaku no gi wo

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
As I plummet, I yearn for thee.
Swear to me thy very life.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
mune no kusabi ni tamuke no sanka shinen no chi e

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
Kiss the cleft of thy breast with my hesitant praise,
As we fall to earth to live the rest of our days.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:38.410
Wa-ha! It's so bright out!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.410
We're at a ski resort today.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.890
It really is crowded, after all!

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.410
Well, it's ski season.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:50.420
Um, this is my first time skiing, so can someone teach me?

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.990
Don't worry, it's simple!

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:53.950
What?

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:56.490
You'll be on a hill, so you slide down no matter what!

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.150
And if you fall, you'll just land on snow, right?

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.260
Wait, could it be that all of you...

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.060
It's our first time!

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.120
Whaaat?

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:09.960
Okay, to the lift!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.570
Ah, please wait for me!

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:20.050
Wow, so that's how you get on!

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.700
Easy peasy!

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.880
Ah, is it my fault again?

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.810
Is it my fault again?

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.960
A Cold Spell Is Snowboarding and Skiing

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:53.960
Pokaan ~ 19

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.370
Well, that's too bad.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:02.200
So, it looks like Aiko can't ride on the lift...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:02.820
Hm...

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.150
What'll we do now?

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.400
It's fine. Don't worry about me.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:12.160
Just go ahead and get on the lift and ski on your own.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.680
Well, I guess they weren't worrying after all.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.850
You guys are all so mean!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.960
Okay, we're getting on the lift for sure this time!

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.650
Wow...

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.850
It's beautiful!

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.000
We're so high up!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.360
Look, look, it's amazing!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.080
Wow...

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.860
Okay, I know it's beautiful, but everyone's looking!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.370
Everyone, everyone! Yay!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.370
Hey, we're almost there!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:58.940
Pachi-chan, Liru! It was so much fun that I'm gonna ride it again!

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:00.130
Hey!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.630
Fun, fun!

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.120
Let's go...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.970
Yeah...

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.400
Hey, you're not bad!

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.860
Let's go to that lift next!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:28.140
Ah, this is the intermediate slope!

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:32.580
Liru, Pachi-chan, yay!

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.370
This lift is great too!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.200
Hey, hey, the downhill is the best!

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.520
It's a great view!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.880
This is my second time!

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.560
Everyone! Yahoo!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.830
So, want to race to the bottom?

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.610
Yeah, I guess so.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.030
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.070
Alright!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.920
This is the best!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.500
Looks like everyone is enjoying themselves!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:21.930
Yay!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.510
Hm?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.640
I did it! I win!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.330
Using your wings is obviously against the rules!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:38.140
Oh, I can't hear you! A win is a win!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.610
Hey, hey!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.420
Hey.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.740
I was watching you from the lift!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.940
Both of you looked so cool!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:50.380
Really? Go on, go on!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.020
I'm so glad we came!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.770
Yeah, skiing is so much fun!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.470
Oh yeah, where's Aiko?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.310
A-Ai-chan?

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.810
Welcome back.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.500
Have you had enough fun for now?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.790
I've been having fun on my own, too!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.340
We've returned everything we rented.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.190
Let's go to the inn!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.190
Ai-chan, where are we staying?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.840
What? I don’t know, but...

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:41.880
I don't know either.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.880
Not me.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:46.960
What?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.540
Um, so who made the reservations?

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:57.890
I'm very sorry, but we don't have any vacancies for the night...

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.560
It's a blizzard out here.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.970
What are we going to do?

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:06.610
Well, I guess now we would normally go try to find some mountain inn?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:10.950
What, we're going to find one? Okay, let's find one, fast.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.160
Yes, you're right.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.110
Would there be an inn at a place like this?

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.640
I have a feeling we've been walking around in circles.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.910
Well, you know how you'll often find a place right as you're about to give up?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.090
I give up!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.220
What's the matter, Liru?

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.300
I hear a child's voice.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.480
A child?

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:32.590
This way!

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:33.590
Liru!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.850
Please wait for me!

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.350
Hey!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.840
What's wrong? What're you doing in a place like this?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.560
This!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.320
How terrible...

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.540
Don't move.  It'll be just...

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.840
Okay, it's off.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.840
Thank you very much.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.950
It doesn't look like you've been injured or anything.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:07.670
So, can you walk?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.170
Yes, probably.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.980
You saved me. Thank you very much.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:20.870
Where are all of you headed now?

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:25.650
Well, we didn't have a place to stay, so we were just looking around.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.150
Oh, in that case, please come to my house!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.980
Is that okay?

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:34.310
Yes! It's not often we get guests out here, so please do!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.160
Alright! Lucky!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.160
Is it really okay for us to intrude?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.370
Please, please! My older brother will be overjoyed, too!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.350
Older brother?

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.420
Elder brother?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:56.330
Thank you so much for saving my little sister.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.390
Please, make yourselves at home.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.140
We'll make ourselves at home!

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:08.040
Miyuki, can you please prepare some food?

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.650
Yes, Onii-sama.

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.380
Wow....

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.090
Go ahead. Don't hesitate and please start eating.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.950
Okay! Thank you for the food!

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.540
This is food that really chills the bottom of your heart, isn't it?

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.440
I'm sorry...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.840
To tell the truth, we have neither electricity nor gas running in the area,

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.300
so we are unable to make anything warm.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.380
What?

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:43.540
Oh, it's nothing! It's probably for the better for our bodies to eat cold food.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.580
It'll burn fat, too!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:48.270
Oh, um, well....

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.800
I'm overjoyed if you are happy despite that.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.440
Now, please!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.390
That sure went well.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.090
Looks like we'll have our first trophies in a while.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.120
But to think four at once...

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:17.390
Hey, Onii-sama! Can I have this one?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.090
So you like that one, huh?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.890
Yeah... I've got a soft spot for wild types..

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.000
Do as you wish!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:32.280
The lives of these creatures will allow us Snow People to sustain our good looks and youth!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.770
Please don't think badly of us!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:40.010
But from now on, your souls will be living with us forever!

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:41.090
I refuse!

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:41.780
What?

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.330
What?! Why aren't you...?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.880
I'm an android, so I can't eat food.

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:53.590
It can't be! An android...

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:59.590
You're saying that you Snow People can't trap the soul of an android?

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.320
That's a strange story, too.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:06.220
You... you can't be...

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.270
We're monsters too!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:13.980
They escaped!

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.990
Hey, what do you want to do with them?

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.500
We should take our time with them...

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.910
Hot pots really are the best thing to have in the winter!

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:31.730
Agreed!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:33.920
We have lots of extras, okay?

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.120
This really warms the bottom of my heart!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:44.560
We're begging you! Please, just leave this place!

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.410
Isn't snow so much fun?

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.470
Living somewhere like this wouldn't be that bad!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.660
Stupid, it's only so much fun because we only come every once in a while.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:30.180
Dealing with it every day would be a pain.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.940
That's right.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:37.890
Frostbite itches, chapped skin hurts, and you'll freeze your butt off!

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:40.190
I doubt Uma could stand it for more than three days.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.690
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:46.130
That's not true! I'm not a kid!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:51.010
Hey anyway, aren't we at least getting close yet?

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:54.210
Oh yeah, wait a second...

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.790
This way is north, so...

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.510
It should be right after we come upon some big rocks.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.210
We're on the right path!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.220
Let's get going!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.500
I wonder what kind of hot spring this will be!

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.430
I heard the water was good for your appearance!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:17.080
No way! If I get any more beautiful, we'll have a problem on our hands!

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:20.280
Alright! That's enough standing around.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:20.730
Okay!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.790
Walking through the snow~

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.150
I can't see my legs!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.810
Ah, it's so peaceful!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:34.200
The Hot Spell is a Spontaneous Onsen

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:34.200
Pokaan ~ 20

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.540
I found it!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.280
Hot springs, hot springs!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:44.720
It seems good, even though I can't see it through the steam.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.930
Wait a second... It looks like there are other visitors.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:52.930
Oh my, hello!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.930
Oh, hello...

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.890
The hot water is great!

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:01.290
Don't just stand there. Come on in!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.940
Please, don't be concerned about us!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.270
Then...

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:34.900
Excuse us!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.060
Please, please!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.980
So where are you girls from?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.730
Hikariga Oka

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.940
Oh? Sorry, I don't know where that is.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.200
How about you ladies?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.880
We're all local, so we come here often.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.280
Thanks to it, look!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.530
My skin is silky smooth!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.790
Me too!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:11.020
Look, me too!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.160
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:43.540
Um... umm....

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.130
Ah! Wh-wh-what are you doing?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.670
You can't do something like that!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.040
I don't swing that way!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:53.600
What?

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.410
She's got nothing here.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.480
Or here...

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.340
Her breasts are even smaller than mine!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.270
It must be so nice....

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.270
Isn't it nice?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.140
Pudding? Marshmallow?

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.460
Hm... not quite...

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:54.290
It's like it sticks to your hand, after all!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.300
You're free to touch me as much as you want until you figure it out!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.900
Eh? Um....

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.060
Aren't they heavy?

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.680
They're really heavy.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:23.530
They make my shoulders ache so much!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:26.310
That's why I come to this hot spring so often.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.320
They're floating in the hot water!

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.620
Well, they're made of fat!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:39.220
Really, if I'm in the hot spring like this, it feels like gravity doesn’t affect me, and I'm in heaven!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.830
A sensation such as isn't something girls like us could truly appreciate, is it?

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.510
I'm envious.

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:45.750
Yep, yep, yep.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.490
What? Oh, don't be so sad.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:53.090
Will ours... get bigger some day?

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:53.510
Eh?

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:59.510
Of course! You don't need to worry, since you got in this hot spring!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.160
How long?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.850
In two or three years, you'll be huge!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:15.530
Huge! Banzai! Banzai! Huge! Banzai! Banzai!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.080
Well, excuse us. We're going to go ahead and leave now.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:27.160
What? You're getting out already?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.750
We've had enough for today.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.350
Please, girls, take your time in here.

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.880
Make sure you soak yourselves well, or you'll catch a cold when you get out!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.510
Okay!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:23.550
There was something like an elephant's trunk down there!

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:26.890
With something like ripe fruit attached at the bottom...

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:42.120
Jeez, they don't have to make such a big deal about it!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.370
Seriously.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.660
It's okay! We're women deep down inside!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.620
Huge!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.850
You shouldn't gape that much!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:57.000
You're girls. You shouldn't mind seeing such things every once and awhile.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.900
Could it be that you're also men?

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.810
Oh, really?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.140
Then, I guess you don't need these!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.100
So it won't be a problem if we take them!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.440
Hey! Our clothes!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.610
How's it look on me?

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:17.950
See you later!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.390
Wait!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.010
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.950
I'm freezing here!

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:30.570
"Freezing" would be a bit of an understatement!

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:32.960
I'm going to freeze solid!

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:35.760
I can't stand it any longer!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.680
Phew, paradise!

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.280
It's not paradise...

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:54.190
We're in trouble... We can't even get out like this.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:21:01.200
After all this getting in and getting out, I can't tell whether I'm hot or cold anymore.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:06.900
Huh?

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.200
Where's... the hot spring?

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:16.670
We were in a hot spring... right?

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.250
There should've been a hot spring here.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.260
Oh, leaves.

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:26.130
Oh.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:35.960
Oh yeah! This is the whole "getting tricked by raccoons" thing!

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.020
Oh! That's what this is!

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:48.240
So, what do we do?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:52.530
Don't tell me we're waiting like this until spring.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:56.780
But we don't have any clothes, so we can't really get out.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:58.630
You're right...

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.300
We're in trouble...

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:30.370
same kitta okazu ja wakimasen yo shokuyoku

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:30.370
You can't satisfy my hunger with cold leftovers!

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:45.870
hokaku shichaimashou tobikkiri no otoko no ko

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:45.870
So how about we land ourselves some choice guys?

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:58.570
ikiru tame dato ka jama kusai desu daigi meibun

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:58.570
My reason for living can be a pain in the tail sometimes.

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:05.200
honnou desu oniku desu u

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:05.200
It's my instincts! It's meat!

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:06.950
doreshido midofado

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:10.880
tsukiyo, mangetsu! chi ga futtou

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:10.880
A night bathed in the light of the full moon makes my blood run wild!

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:13.260
mamama makimoki mukumuku

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.880
pururun kanshoku

00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:16.660
raberabe howahowa

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:23.350
gion wa aru imi koi no jumon

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:23.350
You could say this is a spell of love!

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:26.160
papapa paparun munemune

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:27.760
uttori yussari

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:29.520
petapeta nokinoki

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:34.560
yasseiteki na atashi de GO!

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:34.560
Go out with someone with a wild side -- me!

